        "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
        "revision": 1269951574,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "It is believed that this tree is a \"palace tree\", and should only be planted near palaces. It can be found at Kraton Ngayogyakarta Hadiningrat (the Royal Palace of Yogyakarta), Taman Mini Indonesia Indah theme park in Jakarta, Taman Kiai Langgeng Magelang (a 28 Ha park in the city of Magelang where rare species are studied) and Bogor Botanical Gardens.",
